      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-31T13:56:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>By the rules, you <em>can</em> pass to the Environment/Scene as you would any other actor. Doing what you describe regarding bumping into a different GYRO zone is an intended feature and ruling that the Scene always acts first or last would mean that players can't set things up so that they get a lot of turns in a row (have GM-controlled stuff go early in one round so that they can bunch up hero actions at the end of one round and the start of the next).</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:01.247Z",
