      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>By the rules, you <em>can</em> pass to the Environment/Scene as you would any other actor. Doing what you describe regarding bumping into a different GYRO zone is an intended feature and ruling that the Scene always acts first or last would mean that players can't set things up so that they get a lot of turns in a row (have GM-controlled stuff go early in one round so that they can bunch up hero actions at the end of one round and the start of the next).</p>",
